# Examples

## Calling a mutably capturing closure

```
let mut x = 5;
{
    let mut square_x = || x *= x;
    square_x();
}
assert_eq!(x, 25);
```

## Using a `FnMut` parameter

```
fn do_twice<F>(mut func: F)
    where F: FnMut()
{
    func();
    func();
}

let mut x: usize = 1;
{
    let add_two_to_x = || x += 2;
    do_twice(add_two_to_x);
}

assert_eq!(x, 5);
```
